---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title='Omnichannel retail architecture | Marcelo Ojeda';
const description='Architecture story: evolution from B2B retail operations toward an omnichannel ecosystem connecting stores, e-commerce, marketplaces, ERP, WMS, inventory and logistics.';
---
<BaseLayout {title} {description} lang="en">
<section class="hero"><p class="eyebrow">Architecture Story · 01</p><h1>From B2B operations to an omnichannel ecosystem.</h1><p class="lead">A sustained technology evolution: connecting new digital and physical channels with core systems, inventory and logistics without turning each channel into an isolated system.</p></section>
<section><p class="eyebrow">Challenge</p><h2>Grow without fragmenting operations.</h2><div class="split"><div class="panel"><h3>Context</h3><p>The operation evolved from a primarily B2B model toward omnichannel retail with e-commerce, marketplaces and more than 50 physical stores.</p></div><div class="panel"><h3>Scale</h3><p>Inventory and logistics platforms supported growth from approximately 800 thousand to nearly 5 million managed units.</p></div></div></section>
<section><p class="eyebrow">System view</p><h2>Different channels. One connected operation.</h2><div class="system-map" role="img" aria-label="Conceptual diagram connecting sales channels with commercial integrations, ERP, WMS, inventory and logistics"><div class="row"><span>E-commerce</span><span>Marketplaces</span><span>Physical stores</span></div><div class="flow">↓</div><div class="core">Commercial platform & integrations</div><div class="flow">↓</div><div class="row"><span>ERP</span><span>WMS</span><span>Inventory</span></div><div class="flow">↓</div><div class="core">Logistics operation</div></div><p class="kicker">My work focused on the design and evolution of applications and integrations connecting these domains, while supporting technical decisions around operational continuity and growth.</p></section>
<section><p class="eyebrow">Role</p><h2>Architecture that reaches implementation.</h2><div class="cards"><div class="card"><h3>Integration</h3><p>Design and evolution of integrations across commercial channels, core systems and external operators.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Critical platforms</h3><p>Evolution of systems related to orders, inventory, warehousing and dispatch.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Technical decisions</h3><p>Solution assessment focused on operational continuity, scalability and alignment with business processes.</p></div><div class="card"><h3>Technical depth</h3><p>Hands-on work across backend, APIs, databases and enterprise integration.</p></div></div></section>
<section><p class="eyebrow">Note</p><p class="kicker">This case describes professional patterns, scale and responsibilities. The architecture is intentionally abstracted to avoid exposing confidential topology, configuration or operational information.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/en/">← Back home</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.architecture-canvas{margin:3rem 0;padding:clamp(1.2rem,3vw,2.5rem);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:28px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(115,167,255,.07),rgba(139,92,246,.025) 50%,rgba(255,255,255,.015));box-shadow:0 30px 90px rgba(0,0,0,.25);overflow:hidden}.architecture-canvas header{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem}.architecture-canvas header span{color:var(--accent);font:700 .65rem/1 monospace}.architecture-canvas header p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;font-size:.66rem;font-weight:800}.channel-grid,.core-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:.75rem}.channel-grid div,.core-grid div{padding:1rem 1.1rem;border-radius:14px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.035);border:1px solid var(--line);font-weight:650}.channel-grid b{display:block;color:var(--accent);font-size:.58rem;letter-spacing:.14em;margin-bottom:.3rem}.signal{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;height:58px;color:var(--accent)}.signal i{height:1px;flex:1;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,rgba(115,167,255,.35))}.signal i:last-child{background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(115,167,255,.35),transparent)}.integration{padding:1.4rem 1.6rem;border-radius:18px;background:linear-gradient(110deg,rgba(115,167,255,.14),rgba(139,92,246,.08));border:1px solid rgba(115,167,255,.4);box-shadow:inset 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.06)}.integration small,.integration em{display:block}.integration small{color:var(--accent);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.14em;font-size:.6rem}.integration strong{display:block;font-size:1.3rem;margin:.15rem 0}.integration em{color:var(--muted);font-style:normal;font-size:.78rem}.core-grid .logistics{grid-column:1/-1;text-align:center;border-color:rgba(115,167,255,.25)}@media(max-width:700px){.channel-grid,.core-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.core-grid .logistics{grid-column:auto}}</style>